{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_readme_doc_map", "label": "Documentation Map", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Says which doc to read before which kind of work. The docs describe the system; superpowers/ describes particular pieces of work on it \u2014 a spec is authoritative for its own slice and silent about everything else, and a plan is a record of intent at a moment rather than of what shipped. Where a spec and the code disagree, one of them is a defect: say which, in the spec."}, {"id": "docs_readme_skills_declared_not_vendored", "label": "Skills Are Declared, Not Vendored", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Copying them into .claude/skills/ forked them from their upstream repository \u2014 edit one and the other silently stops matching, on every machine independently. .claude/settings.json declares plugins and marketplaces; .agents/skills/ is a gitignored materialized cache, because committing it would fork the skills again."}, {"id": "docs_readme_decisions_not_bugs", "label": "Things That Look Like Bugs But Are Decisions", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "STORED generated columns, batched last_accessed_at, STORE-not-DEFLATE bundles, thumbnails as bytea with no images/ directory and no config file in the store, quarantined_at as a column with nothing behind it yet, and the watcher living in the native agent. One entry is admitted as a gap rather than a decision: the derivative cache is blobs/, a sibling of libraries/, not cache/blobs/ as the slice spec drew it."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_readme_skills_declared_not_vendored", "target": "agents_project_skills_materialization", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_readme_doc_map", "target": "docs_architecture_crate_graph", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_readme_doc_map", "target": "docs_data_three_storage_classes", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_readme_doc_map", "target": "docs_features_phase_tags_and_non_goals", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_readme_doc_map", "target": "docs_prototype_notes_domain_shape", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_readme_doc_map", "target": "claude_lapidary_working_rules", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_readme_decisions_not_bugs", "target": "claude_stored_generated_columns", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_readme_decisions_not_bugs", "target": "docs_data_access_tracking_batching", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_readme_decisions_not_bugs", "target": "docs_data_thumbnails_in_postgres", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_